DESCRIPTION:Building custom managers in Django greatly enhances your data r
 etrieval process\, abstracting the logic in the manager methods. When the 
 ORM isn't enough you can add raw SQL\, but once your queries start to grow
 \, it might be hard to manage user-defined arguments\, repeated logic and 
 many other aspects. In this talk\, I'll show you how you can use templatin
 g engines like Jinja2 to build reusable\, extensible and easy to understan
 d raw SQL templates\, used by your manager to improve your data retrieval 
 process.
DTSTAMP:20261116T105841Z
LOCATION:Auditorium
SUMMARY:Pushing the Boundaries of Django Managers - João Vasconcelos
